invariant: INV-14
file: src/srv.c
catches: srv_auth_test
reason: a server takes a ticket_key_previous while ticket_key is NULL. It
  then issues no ticket, and the previous key opens none, because
  srv_resume.c judges no ticket without ticket_key. srv_cfg.h refuses
  the pair, and test/srv_identity_tests.h's test_previous_ticket_key
  requires CH_EINVAL (docs/decisions.md 220).

--- old
        return srv->ticket_key_previous == NULL;
--- new
        return 1;
